#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19516"
msgid "Platinum Plate"
msgstr "Plato de Platino"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "82776"
msgid "Made of some of the rarest metal in the world. Could fetch a small fortune at a pawn shop."
msgstr "Fabricado con uno de los metales más raros del mundo. Podrías ganar una pequeña fortuna en una casa de empeños."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19531"
msgid "Gold Plate"
msgstr "Plato de Oro"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "82867"
msgid "The gold standard in plates. Could go for quite a lot at a pawn shop."
msgstr "Un plato de oro puro. Podría valer bastante en una casa de empeños."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19542"
msgid "Silver Plate"
msgstr "Plato de Plata"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "82937"
msgid "This well-crafted plate could net a hefty sum over at a pawn shop."
msgstr "Un plato cuidadosamente elaborado. Podría valer una cantidad importante de dinero en una casa de empeños."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19555"
msgid "Bronze Plate"
msgstr "Plato de Bronce"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83004"
msgid "A plate made of bronze. Nothing special, but it could probably fetch some decent cash."
msgstr "Un plato hecho de bronce. Nada especial, pero se puede vender por un poco de dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19568"
msgid "Iron Plate"
msgstr "Plato de Hierro"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83091"
msgid "A plate made of iron. Nothing special, but it could probably fetch a little cash.  "
msgstr "Un plato hecho de hierro. Nada especial, pero podría valer algo.  "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19579"
msgid "Oden Soup"
msgstr "Sopa Oden"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83175"
msgid "Oden Soup is perfect for cold winter days. There's actually quite a lot in here.  "
msgstr "El Oden es perfecto para los dias fríos de invierno. De hecho, hay bastante aquí.  "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19589"
msgid "Seaweed Onigiri"
msgstr "Alga de Onigiri"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83258"
msgid "A rice ball with boiled seaweed at its center."
msgstr "Onigiri relleno con alga cocida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19605"
msgid "Tuna Onigiri"
msgstr "Onigiri de Atún"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83305"
msgid "This rice ball has tuna dressed with mayonnaise in the middle."
msgstr "Exquisito onigiri que lleva atún mezclado con mayonesa en el centro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19618"
msgid "Salmon Onigiri"
msgstr "Onigiri de Salmón"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83368"
msgid "A standard rice ball with salmon flake filling."
msgstr "Bola de arroz común con relleno de salmón escamado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19633"
msgid "Bento Lunch Set"
msgstr "Set de Almuerzo Bento"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83416"
msgid "Your average bento lunch. This is enough to fill you up.  "
msgstr "Tu bento habitual, es suficiente para satisfacerte.  "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19649"
msgid "Pork Tonkatsu Bento"
msgstr "Bento Tonkatsu de Cerdo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83475"
msgid "A tonkatsu lunch set made with rich Satsuma pork."
msgstr "Un menú de almuerzo de tonkatsu con rico cerdo Satsuma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19669"
msgid "Club Sandwich"
msgstr "Club Sandwich"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83525"
msgid "A standard clubhouse sandwich with tomatoes, lettuce, and cheese."
msgstr "Un sandwich 'club' común con tomate, lechuga y queso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19683"
msgid "Tuna & Egg Sandwich"
msgstr "Sandwich de Atún y Huevo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83591"
msgid "Tuna, egg, and mayo on white bread."
msgstr "Atún, huevo y mayonesa sobre pan blanco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19703"
msgid "Special Yakisoba"
msgstr "Yakisoba Especial"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83627"
msgid "Yakisoba with cabbage and pork. The smell of the sauce is simply irresistible."
msgstr "Yakisoba con col y cerdo. El olor de la salsa es simplemente irresistible."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19720"
msgid "Steamed Bun"
msgstr "Bollo al Vapor"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83706"
msgid "A regular item at convenience stores. Popular for its superb flavor."
msgstr "Un artículo común en tiendas de conveniencia. Popular por su magnífico sabor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19732"
msgid "Bean Paste Bun"
msgstr "Bollo de Pasta de Frijoles"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83775"
msgid "A regular item at convenience stores. Popular for its sesame-flavored strained bean paste."
msgstr "Un artículo común en tiendas de conveniencia. Popular por su pasta de judías procesada con sabor a sésamo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19747"
msgid "Yakisoba Bun"
msgstr "Bollo de Yakisoba"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83866"
msgid "A Chinese-style steamed bun with yakisoba noodles in the middle. The sauce smells great."
msgstr "Un bollo chino al vapor con fideos Yakisoba en el medio. La salsa huele genial."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19760"
msgid "Sake"
msgstr "Sake"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "83955"
msgid "This large bottle of rice wine can be enjoyed heated or chilled."
msgstr "Esta botella grande de vino de arroz puede disfrutarse tanto caliente como fría."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19765"
msgid "Dog Food"
msgstr "Alimento para Perros"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84020"
msgid "Dry dog food. Contains a well-balanced mix of nutrients."
msgstr "Comida seca para perros. Contiene una mezcla de nutrientes bien balanceada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19774"
msgid "Sushi Set"
msgstr "Set de Sushi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84077"
msgid "Carefully selected nigiri-style sushi in a box. Includes only high-quality fish. Expensive."
msgstr "Sushi estilo nigiri, cuidadosamente seleccionado y presentado en una caja. Solo con pescado de alta calidad. Caro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19784"
msgid "Blended Coffee"
msgstr "Café Mezclado"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84169"
msgid "A blend of Mandheling and Brazilian beans with a Colombian base."
msgstr "Una mezcla de granos mandheling y brasileños con una base colombiana."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19799"
msgid "Blue Mountain"
msgstr "Montaña Azul"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84234"
msgid "This is the ultimate cup of coffee, made with rich, top-grade coffee beans."
msgstr "Esta es la taza de café definitiva, elaborada con granos de café de primera calidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19813"
msgid "Mocha"
msgstr "Moca"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84310"
msgid "Countless coffee drinkers love mocha-style coffee for its rich, bitter flavor."
msgstr "Incontables amantes del café adoran el café estilo moka por su sabor intenso y amargo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19819"
msgid "Earl Grey Tea"
msgstr "Té Earl Grey"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84389"
msgid "Enjoy the citrus bergamot fragrance of this tea grown in Sri Lanka under an exclusive contract."
msgstr "Disfruta del aroma a bergamota cítrica de este té cultivado en Sri Lanka bajo un contrato exclusivo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19833"
msgid "Milk Tea"
msgstr "Té de Leche"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84485"
msgid "Assam tea leaves from a tea farm under our exclusive contract that have been carefully brewed with creamy pasteurized milk from Hokkaido."
msgstr "Hojas de té Assam de una plantación con la que tenemos un contrato exclusivo, cuidadosamente infusionadas con leche cremosa pasteurizada de Hokkaido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19842"
msgid "Tomato Juice"
msgstr "Jugo de Tomate"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84623"
msgid "Made with healthy, organic tomatoes."
msgstr "Hecho con tomates saludables y orgánicos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19855"
msgid "Lemon Tea"
msgstr "Té de Limón"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84660"
msgid "Richly scented tea from the hills of Nuwara Eliya in Sri Lanka, combined with organic lemon."
msgstr "Té con un aroma intenso, proveniente de las colinas de Nuwara Eliya en Sri Lanka. Combinado con limón orgánico."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19865"
msgid "Strawberry Parfait"
msgstr "Parfait de Fresa"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84753"
msgid "A creamy parfait loaded with fresh strawberries."
msgstr "Un parfait cremoso cargado de fresas frescas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19884"
msgid "Chocolate Parfait"
msgstr "Parfait de Chocolate"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84802"
msgid "A sizable parfait loaded with rich, delicious chocolate."
msgstr "Un parfait grande cargado de chocolate rico y delicioso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19902"
msgid "Green Tea Float"
msgstr "Té Verde Flotante"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84859"
msgid "A popular float made with Uji green tea and creamy vanilla ice cream."
msgstr "Un popular helado flotante hecho con matcha Uji y un cremoso helado de vainilla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19918"
msgid "Toast Set"
msgstr "Set de Tostadas"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84929"
msgid "A fried egg, bacon, toast, and your choice of coffee or tea."
msgstr "Huevo frito, tocino, tostada y un café o té de tu elección."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19928"
msgid "Sandwich Set"
msgstr "Set de Sandwich"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84990"
msgid "This set offers a bacon, egg, and lettuce sandwich on white bread."
msgstr "Este set incluye un sandwich de huevo, tocino y lechuga en pan blanco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19941"
msgid "Pasta Set"
msgstr "Set de Pasta"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85057"
msgid "Tuna and cream pasta with a drink."
msgstr "Pasta de atún y crema con una bebida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19951"
msgid "Cake Set"
msgstr "Set de Pastel"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85092"
msgid "Our signature shortcake and a drink."
msgstr "Nuestro característico pastel de crema y una bebida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19960"
msgid "Original Beef Curry Set"
msgstr "Set de Curry de Vacuno Original"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85129"
msgid "The roux in this beef curry is our own house recipe."
msgstr "El roux en este curry de carne es una receta exclusiva de nuestro local."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19984"
msgid "Beef Rice"
msgstr "Arroz con Carne"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85182"
msgid "As advertised, our Beef Rice meal comes with succulent, tender beef and miso soup."
msgstr "Un delicioso bowl de arroz que lleva suculenta y tierna carne de res. Siempre acompañado con una sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19994"
msgid "Beef Rice (L)"
msgstr "Arroz con Carne (L)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85265"
msgid "As advertised, our large Beef Rice meal comes with succulent, tender beef and miso soup."
msgstr "Un delicioso gran bowl de arroz que lleva suculenta y tierna carne de res. Siempre Acompañado con una sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20008"
msgid "Pork Rice"
msgstr "Arroz con Cerdo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85354"
msgid "Our Pork Rice meal is a new menu item. We make sure to bring out the original pork flavor. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Nuestra nueva opción en el menú es el arroz con cerdo. Nos aseguramos de resaltar el sabor auténtico del cerdo. Viene acompañado de sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20018"
msgid "Pork Rice (L)"
msgstr "Arroz con Cerdo (L)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85467"
msgid "Our large Pork Rice meal is a new menu item. We make sure to bring out the original pork flavor. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Nuestra nueva opción en el menú es el arroz con cerdo en porcion grande. Nos aseguramos de resaltar el sabor auténtico del cerdo. Viene acompañado de sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20032"
msgid "Bibimbap"
msgstr "Bibimbap"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85586"
msgid "A bowl of spicy bibimbap. Topped with a salty sweet gochujang sauce and comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Un tazón de bibimbap picante, cubierto con una salsa de gochujang agridulce y acompañado de una sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20041"
msgid "Bibimbap (L)"
msgstr "Bibimbap (L)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85680"
msgid "A large bowl of spicy bibimbap. Topped with a salty sweet gochujang sauce and comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Un tazón grande de bibimbap picante, cubierto con una salsa de gochujang agridulce y acompañado de una sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20054"
msgid "Original Curry & Rice"
msgstr "Curry Original y Arroz"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85780"
msgid "As advertised, our Original Curry & Rice meal is made with substantial chunks of tasty meat. Comes with miso soup on the side."
msgstr "Tal como se anuncia, nuestro curry y arroz original está hecha con trozos grandes de carne sabrosa. Viene acompañada de sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20076"
msgid "Original Curry & Rice (L)"
msgstr "Curry Original y Arroz (L)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "85907"
msgid "As advertised, our large Original Curry & Rice meal is made with substantial chunks of tasty meat. Comes with miso soup on the side."
msgstr "Tal como se anuncia, esta gran porción de curry y arroz original está hecha con trozos grandes de carne sabrosa. Viene acompañada de sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20102"
msgid "Beef Curry"
msgstr "Curry de Vacuno"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86040"
msgid "Enjoy our most popular menu item: a whole plateful of curry loaded with tender chunks of beef. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Disfruta nuestro plato más popular: un tazón lleno de curry cargado con tiernos trozos de ternera. Viene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20113"
msgid "Kimchi & Kalbi"
msgstr "Kimchi y Kalbi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86157"
msgid "Our Kimchi & Kalbi set is an especially popular choice. Juicy, BBQ kalbi beef topped with kimchi on rice. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Nuestro combo de Kimchi y Kalbi es particularmente popular. Kimchi sobre arroz que lleva una jugosa carne BBQ Kalbi. Viene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20128"
msgid "Kimchi & Kalbi (L)"
msgstr "Kimchi y Kalbi (L)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86285"
msgid "Our large Kimchi & Kalbi set is an especially popular choice. Juicy, BBQ kalbi beef topped with kimchi on rice. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Nuestro combo grande de Kimchi y Kalbi es particularmente popular. Kimchi sobre arroz que lleva una jugosa carne BBQ Kalbi. Viene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20147"
msgid "Beef Yakiniku Meal"
msgstr "Almuerzo Yakiniku de Ternera"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86419"
msgid "The Beef Yakiniku Meal is one of our popular standard entrées on the menu: a plate of juicy BBQ beef that comes with rice, miso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "El Yakiniku de Res es uno de nuestros platos principales más populares en el menú: un plato de jugosa carne BBQ acompañada de arroz, sopa de miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20166"
msgid "Kalbi Yakiniku Meal"
msgstr "Almuerzo Yakiniku Galbi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86570"
msgid "Our popular Kalbi Yakiniku Set is made with juicy BBQ rib meat and tasty sauce. Comes with rice, miso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "Nuestro popular kalbi yakiniku está hecho con jugosa carne de costilla BBQ y sabrosa salsa. Viene con arroz, sopa de miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20186"
msgid "Demitama Hamburg Meal"
msgstr "Almuerzo Demitama Hamburgués"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86694"
msgid "A hot, juicy hamburg steak topped with egg and sweet demiglace sauce, served with rice, miso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "Un jugoso y caliente filete de hamburguesa cubierto con\nhuevo y salsa demi-glace dulce. Servido con arroz, sopa\nde miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20208"
msgid "Pork Yakiniku Meal"
msgstr "Almuerzo Yakiniku de Cerdo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86809"
msgid "Our Pork Yakiniku Meal has great-tasting pork for great stamina. Comes with rice, miso soup, fresh vegetables, and grated daikon."
msgstr "Nuestro Yakiniku de Cerdo tiene un gran sabor para una gran resistencia. Incluye arroz, sopa de miso, verduras frescas y daikon rallado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20227"
msgid "Ginger Pork Meal"
msgstr "Almuerzo de Cerdo al Jengibre"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "86939"
msgid "The Ginger Pork Meal comes with plenty of succulent pork, white rice, miso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "El cerdo al jengible viene con un abundante y suculento cerdo, arroz blanco, sopa de miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20244"
msgid "Original Curry Take-home Pack"
msgstr "Pack de Curry Original para Llevar a Casa"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87036"
msgid "Matsuya Original Curry in a take-home pack. Heat the pack up in hot water for a tasty meal."
msgstr "El curry original de Matsuya en un paquete para llevar. Calienta el paquete en agua caliente para disfrutar de una comida deliciosa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "20274"
msgid "Kamuro Gourmet"
msgstr "Kamuro Gourmet"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "87128"
msgid "A free magazine chock full of information on Kamurocho's restaurants. It's got coupons for great deals, too."
msgstr "Una revista gratuita repleta de información sobre los restaurantes de Kamurocho. También incluye cupones para ofertas increíbles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20289"
msgid "Night Magazine"
msgstr "Revista Nocturna"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87237"
msgid "A magazine with info on hot nightspots. It's got coupons for hostess clubs."
msgstr "Una revista con información sobre los mejores sitios nocturnos. También incluye cupones para clubes de anfitrionas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20304"
msgid "Dummy 1"
msgstr "Maniquí 1"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87313"
msgid "Dummy"
msgstr "Dummy"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20312"
msgid "Dummy 2"
msgstr "Maniquí 2"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87319"
msgid "Dummy"
msgstr "Dummy"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20320"
msgid "Drama Homme I"
msgstr "Drama Masculino"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87325"
msgid "A cologne by FITS. Its lavender and vanilla scent guarantee a dramatic night to come."
msgstr "Una colonia de FITS. Su fragancia de lavanda y vainilla garantiza una noche inolvidable."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20334"
msgid "Drama Femme"
msgstr "Drama Femenino"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "87411"
msgid "A perfume by FITS. The smell of cassis, vanilla, and raspberry creates an elegant, sensuous aura."
msgstr "Un perfume de FITS. Su combinación de cassis, vainilla y frambuesa crea un aura elegante y sensual."

