msgstr "Un trozo de bardana, con toda la textura crujiente y el aroma fresco que este saludable vegetal aporta a la mesa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20863"
msgid "Spicy Fries"
msgstr "Papas Fritas Picantes"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89287"
msgid "Made by seasoning Hokkaido Matilda potatoes with green chili peppers and chipotle salt."
msgstr "Elaborado sazonando papas Matilda de Hokkaido con chiles verdes y sal de chipotle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20875"
msgid "Oven-roasted Chorizo Sausage"
msgstr "Chorizo Asado al Horno"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89375"
msgid "Seasoned with green chili peppers and chipotle salt before roasting in an oven."
msgstr "Sazonado con chiles verdes y sal de chipotle antes de asarlo en el horno."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20904"
msgid "Garlic Butter Akkeshi Whelks"
msgstr "Buccino con Mantequilla de Ajo Akkeshi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89455"
msgid "Made with large, tender whelks from the Akkeshi region."
msgstr "Elaborado con buccinos grandes y tiernos de la región Akkeshi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20933"
msgid "Margherita Roman Pizza"
msgstr "Pizza Margarita Romana"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89511"
msgid "This basic Roman pizza is made with fresh tomato sauce and basil."
msgstr "Esta pizza romana básica está hecha con tomates frescos y albahaca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20956"
msgid "Gin Buck"
msgstr "Gin Buck"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89577"
msgid "This gin-based cocktail is mixed with ginger ale and a squeeze of lime."
msgstr "Este cóctel a base de ginebra se mezcla con ginger-ale y un chorrito de limón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20965"
msgid "Tequila Rickey With Lime"
msgstr "Tequila Rickey con Lima"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89649"
msgid "This delicious drink is made by mixing tequila with soda and plenty of lime."
msgstr "Esta deliciosa bebida se prepara mezclando tequila con soda y abundante limón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "20990"
msgid "Tequila & Blood Orange"
msgstr "Tequila y Naranja Sanguina"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89726"
msgid "This cocktail is a mixture of tequila with bittersweet blood orange juice."
msgstr "Este cóctel es una mezcla de tequila con jugo de naranja sanguina agridulce."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21013"
msgid "Campari & Soda"
msgstr "Campari y Soda"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89801"
msgid "A drink loved the world over for its bittersweet magic."
msgstr "Una bebida amada en todo el mundo por su magia agridulce."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21028"
msgid "Kahlua & Milk"
msgstr "Kahlua y Leche"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89857"
msgid "A mixture of Kahlua liqueur and milk for everyone's favorite cocktail."
msgstr "Una mezcla de licor Kahlua y leche para hacer el cóctel favorito de todos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21042"
msgid "Kaku-XL Highball"
msgstr "Jaibol Kaku-XL"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89928"
msgid "This drink is made by mixing Kakubin with lemon and soda. The \"XL\" refers to its size, so you can take your time drinking it."
msgstr "Esta bebida se prepara mezclando Kakubin con limón y soda. El \"XL\" hace referencia a su tamaño, así que puedes disfrutarla con calma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21059"
msgid "Light Kaku-XL Highball"
msgstr "Jaibol Light Kaku-XL"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90054"
msgid "This lighter drink made by mixing Kakubin with enough lemon and soda to soften the taste. The \"XL\" refers to its size."
msgstr "Esta bebida ligera se prepara mezclando Kakubin con suficiente limón y soda para suavizar el sabor. El \"XL\" hace referencia a su tamaño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21082"
msgid "Malibu Cola"
msgstr "Cola Malibu"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90173"
msgid "A popular cocktail with a coconut flavor that will remind you of a warm southern island."
msgstr "Un cóctel popular con sabor a coco que te recordará a una cálida isla del sur."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21094"
msgid "Copper Yamazaki Highball"
msgstr "Jaibol de Cobre Yamazaki"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90262"
msgid "Yamazaki whisky mixed with lemon and soda served in a copper tumbler to keep it cold."
msgstr "Whisky Yamazaki mezclado con limón y soda, servido en un vaso de cobre para mantenerlo frío."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21119"
msgid "Eggplant Bacon Spaghetti"
msgstr "Espagueti de Berenjena y Tocino"

