msgstr "Helado popular hecho con dulces frijoles azuki."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21433"
msgid "Caramel Gelato"
msgstr "Helado de Caramelo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91788"
msgid "A popular dessert featuring vanilla gelato topped with warm caramel."
msgstr "Un popular postre que presenta helado de vainilla cubierto con caramelo tibio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21448"
msgid "Coffee Gelato"
msgstr "Helado de Café"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91857"
msgid "A single scoop of coffee gelato made with high-quality mocha bean extract."
msgstr "Una cucharada de helado de café elaborado con extracto de moca de granos de alta calidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21462"
msgid "Double Scoop"
msgstr "Helado Doble"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91932"
msgid "Enjoy a double scoop of two rich flavors."
msgstr "Disfruta de dos bolas de helado con dos sabores exquisitos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21475"
msgid "Triple Scoop"
msgstr "Helado Triple"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91974"
msgid "Enjoy three flavors at once with this creamy triple scoop."
msgstr "Disfruta de tres sabores a la vez con esta cremosa bola triple."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21488"
msgid "Organic Soybean Yose Dofu"
msgstr "Soya Orgánica Yose Dofu"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92033"
msgid "Tofu handmade from the finest organic soybeans, allowing the rich, natural flavor to come through."
msgstr "Tofu hecho a mano con los mejores frijoles de soja orgánica, que permite que el sabor natural y rico se destaque."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21514"
msgid "Chicken Karaage"
msgstr "Karaage de Pollo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92132"
msgid "Fried Chicken is one of our most popular items. The contrast of its crispy skin and juicy meat is to die for."
msgstr "El pollo frito es uno de nuestros platos más populares. El contraste entre la piel crujiente y la carne jugosa está de muerte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21530"
msgid "Fermented Bean & Yam Omelet"
msgstr "Frijoles Fermentados y Tortilla de Ñame"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92242"
msgid "This soft, expertly scrambled and rolled omelet boasts the mild flavor of grated yam and fermented soybeans."
msgstr "Este suave omelette, cuidadosamente revuelta y enrollada, destaca por el sabor suave de la batata rallada y los frijoles de soja fermentados."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21558"
