msgstr "Asado de Caballa Hokkaido"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92351"
msgid "Fresh Hokkaido mackerel slowly broiled to embody the true flavor of Hokkaido."
msgstr "Caballa fresca de Hokkaido, asada lentamente para capturar el sabor auténtico de Hokkaido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21584"
