msgstr "Plato de Sashimi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92695"
msgid "This Sashimi Platter is made up of five varieties, allowing you to enjoy the delicious seafood of the season."
msgstr "Esta tabla de sashimi incluye de cinco variedades, para que puedas disfrutar del delicioso marisco de temporada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21658"
msgid "Chocolate & Green Tea Ice Cream"
msgstr "Helado de chocolate y té verde"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92805"
msgid "The thick, creamy fondant chocolate and the flavorful green tea ice cream are a perfect match."
msgstr "Este fondant de chocolate, espeso y cremoso, junto con el sabroso helado de té verde, crean una combinación perfecta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21690"
msgid "Tomato Bacon Pizza"
msgstr "Pizza de tomate y tocino"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92900"
msgid "Tomato pizza with thick bacon slices. The slow-cooked, handmade sauce of tomato and garlic makes this pizza heavenly."
msgstr "Pizza de tomate con grandes rebanadas de tocino. La salsa de tomate artesanal, cocinada a fuego lento con ajo, hace que esta pizza sea celestial."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21709"
msgid "Stone-cooked Shark's Fin Fried Rice"
msgstr "Arroz frito con aleta de tiburón cocido a la piedra"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93018"
msgid "The shark's fin sauce and fried rice are a brilliant combination."
msgstr "La salsa de aleta de tiburón y el arroz frito son una combinación brillante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21745"
msgid "The Premium Malt's Draft"
msgstr "La Malta Premium"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93084"
msgid "The Premium Malt's, the true premium beer, is now on tap. From first mug to last, a taste that never disappoints."
msgstr "El Premium Malt's, la verdadera cerveza premium, ya está disponible en barril. Desde la primera hasta la última copa, su sabor nunca decepciona."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21770"
msgid "Yuzu Honey Sour"
msgstr "Miel agria Yuzu"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93198"
msgid "Yuzu honey tops a refreshing yuzu sour base in this deliciously citrus drink."
msgstr "La miel de yuzu complementa una base refrescante de yuzu sour en esta deliciosa bebida cítrica."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21786"
msgid "Oolong Tea"
msgstr "Té Oolong"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93276"
msgid "Oolong tea is the quintessential non-alcoholic drink. Enjoy its exquisite fragrance and flavor."
msgstr "El té oolong es la bebida no alcohólica por excelencia. Disfrute de su exquisita fragancia y sabor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21797"
msgid "Kishu Nanko Plum Sour"
msgstr "Ciruela agria Kishu Nanko"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93372"
msgid "A refreshing sour cocktail made with tart Kishu Nanko plums."
msgstr "Un cóctel agrio y refrescante hecho con ciruelas Kishu Nanko."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21819"
msgid "Oolong Cocktail"
msgstr "Cóctel Oolong"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93433"
msgid "The distinctive flavor of oolong tea really comes through in this cocktail. Goes well with any food."
msgstr "El sabor distintivo de té oolong realmente se destaca en este coctel. Va bien con cualquier tipo de comida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21835"
msgid "Umeshu on the Rocks"
msgstr "Umeshu con hielo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93534"
msgid "Umeshu on the Rocks lets you enjoy all the flavor of fine plum liqueur on its own, pure and undiluted."
msgstr "Umeshu en las rocas te permite disfrutar del sabor completo de un licor de ciruela de alta calidad, puro y sin diluir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21855"
msgid "Grapefruit & Apple Vinegar Sour"
msgstr "Vinagre agrio de manzana y toronja"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93637"
msgid "The tart flavor of fruit paired with the scent of apple cider vinegar makes this unique drink popular with the ladies."
msgstr "El sabor ácido de la fruta combinado con el aroma del vinagre de manzana hace que esta bebida única sea popular entre las damas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21887"
msgid "Kaku Highball"
msgstr "Whisky de soda duro"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93756"
msgid "This drink is all the rage right now. It's not too strong and goes well with meals."
msgstr "Esta bebida está en auge en este momento. No es demasiado fuerte y combina bien con las comidas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21901"
msgid "Moscow Mule"
msgstr "Mula de Moscú"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93840"
msgid "A well-known cocktail made with vodka, lime juice, and ginger ale."
msgstr "Un cóctel bien conocido hecho con vodka, jugo de limón y ginger-ale."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21913"
msgid "Gin and Tonic"
msgstr "Gin-tonic"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93907"
msgid "A classic cocktail of gin mixed with tonic water and lime juice."
msgstr "Un cóctel clásico de ginebra mezclado con agua tónica y jugo de limón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21927"
msgid "Cassis & Orange"
msgstr "Licor de Cassis y Naranja"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "93972"
msgid "This extremely popular cocktail is made with one hundred percent orange juice."
msgstr "Este cóctel extremadamente popular se hace con jugo de naranja puro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21943"
msgid "Tropical Sunrise"
msgstr "Amanecer tropical"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94051"
msgid "A fruity cocktail that blends the flavors of strawberry, banana, and pineapple."
msgstr "Un cóctel frutal que mezcla los sabores de la fresa, plátano y piña."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21960"
msgid "Mugwort"
msgstr "Artemisa"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94131"
msgid "A grass that grows naturally in Japan. Often served mixed into sticky rice cakes."
msgstr "Una hierba que crece de forma natural en Japón. A menudo se sirve mezclada en pastelitos de arroz mochi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21968"
msgid "Boss Rainbow Mountain Blend"
msgstr "Mezcla del Jefe de la Montaña Arcoiris"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94213"
msgid "Canned coffee specially brewed with top-quality Guatemalan beans to bring out the flavor."
msgstr "Café en lata especialmente preparado con granos guatemaltecos de primera calidad para realzar su sabor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "21996"
msgid "Boss Luxury Sweet"
msgstr "Boss Luxury Sweet"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94303"
msgid "Luxurious canned coffee made with high-quality coffee beans."
msgstr "Café enlatado de lujo elaborado con granos de café de alta calidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22014"
msgid "Black Boss"
msgstr "Black Boss"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94364"
msgid "Dripped at a low temperature with espresso for a smooth blend that goes down easy."
msgstr "Gotas filtradas a baja temperatura con espresso obteniendo una mezcla suave que se bebe fácilmente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22025"
msgid "Suntory Oolong Tea"
msgstr "Té Oolong Suntory"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94447"
msgid "Oolong tea is famous for its thick, rich flavor and light aftertaste."
msgstr "El té oolong es famoso por su sabor intenso y rico, con un regusto ligero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22044"
msgid "Suntory Black Oolong Tea"
msgstr "Té Negro Oolong Suntory"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94517"
msgid "This tea goes good with anything. The polyphenol it contains is said to eliminate fat content."
msgstr "Este té combina bien con cualquier cosa. Se dice que el polifenol que contiene ayuda a eliminar la grasa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22069"
msgid "Suntory Mineral Water"
msgstr "Agua Mineral de Suntory"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94612"
msgid "Mineral water from the Minami Alps, extracted from the virgin snow atop Mount Kai-Komagatake."
msgstr "Agua mineral de los Minami Alps. Extraída de la nieve virgen de la cima del monte Kai-Komagatake."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22091"
msgid "Iyemon (Green Tea)"
msgstr "Iyemon (Té Verde)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94706"
msgid "Carefully selected tea leaves brewed with spring water by Kyoto's reputable Fukujuen Tea Company."
msgstr "Hojas de té cuidadosamente seleccionadas y preparadas con agua de manantial por la reputada Compañía de Té Fukujuen de Kioto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22110"
msgid "Iyemon Rich (Green Tea)"
msgstr "Iyemon Rich (Té Verde)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94804"
msgid "Tea brewed with carefully selected ingredients from Kyoto's reputable Fukujuen Tea Company."
msgstr "Té elaborado con ingredientes cuidadosamente seleccionados de la reputada Compañía de Té Fukujuen de Kioto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "22134"
msgid "C.C. Lemon"
msgstr "C.C. Lemon"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "94896"
msgid "A bottle of carbonated soda packed with 70 lemons worth of vitamin C."
msgstr "Una botella de gaseosa con vitamina C equivalente a 70 limones."

