#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "25911"
msgid "High-grade Platinum"
msgstr "Platino de alta calidad"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108775"
msgid "A block of platinum that evokes the elegance of rare metals."
msgstr "Un bloque de platino que evoca la elegancia de los metales raros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "25931"
msgid "Ancient Steel"
msgstr "Acero Antiguo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108836"
msgid "This Ancient Steel was used to forge swords long ago."
msgstr "Este Acero Antiguo fue usado para forjar espadas hace mucho tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "25945"
msgid "Magnetized Metal"
msgstr "Metal Imantado"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108890"
msgid "A magnetized chunk of metal that exerts a strong magnetic force."
msgstr "Un pedazo de metal magnetizado que ejerce una gran fuerza magnética."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "25962"
msgid "Block of Brass"
msgstr "Bloque de Latón"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108955"
msgid "Your average block of brass."
msgstr "Tu bloque de latón promedio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "25977"
msgid "Chunk of Wood (Sacred)"
msgstr "Trozo de madera (Sagrado)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108984"
msgid "Wood from a thousand-year-old sacred tree. Both awe-inspiring and ominous..."
msgstr "Madera del sagrado árbol milenario. Tan imponente como inquietante..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26000"
msgid "Chunk of Wood (Maple)"
msgstr "Trozo de Madera (Arce)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109061"
msgid "Wood from a maple tree. People use this to make bats."
msgstr "Madera de arce. Se usa para fabricar bates."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26022"
msgid "Chunk of Wood (Ash)"
msgstr "Trozo de Madera (Fresno)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109115"
msgid "Wood from a Japanese ash tree. People use this to make baseball bats."
msgstr "Madera de un fresno japonés. Se usa para fabricar bates."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26042"
msgid "Eye of the Dragon"
msgstr "Ojo de dragón"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109185"
msgid "A crimson stone that draws you in with its beauty. Seems ancient and mysterious."
msgstr "Una piedra carmesí que te atrapa con su belleza. Parece antigua y misteriosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26060"
msgid "Diamond"
msgstr "Diamante"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109266"
msgid "The king of all gemstones. Selling it may be your only option."
msgstr "El rey de todas las piedras preciosas. No te queda otra que venderla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26068"
msgid "Ruby"
msgstr "Rubí"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109329"
msgid "A very popular stone. Selling it may be your only option."
msgstr "Una piedra muy popular. No te queda otra que venderla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26073"
msgid "Pearl"
msgstr "Perla"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109387"
msgid "This pearl isn't worth very much. Maybe I can use it for something."
msgstr "Esta perla no vale mucho. Tal vez pueda usarla para algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26079"
msgid "Bloody Cloth"
msgstr "Tela Ensangrentada"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109455"
msgid "A cloth used by a fighter at the Coliseum that is now drenched in dried blood."
msgstr "Una tela utilizada por un luchador del Coliseo, ahora empapada en sangre seca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26092"
msgid "Mystery Stone"
msgstr "Piedra Misteriosa"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109534"
msgid "This stone gives off a rare diffusing reflection. Maybe I can use it for something."
msgstr "Esta piedra emite un reflejo extraño y difuso. Tal vez pueda usarla para algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26106"
msgid "Demon Stone"
msgstr "Piedra del Demonio"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109618"
msgid "A demon's hideous face is drawn on this stone. It has something to do with a guardian faith."
msgstr "La horrible cara de un demonio está dibujada en esta piedra. Tiene algo que ver con una fe protectora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26118"
msgid "Super High-voltage Battery"
msgstr "Batería de súper alto voltaje"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109711"
msgid "Can't be obtained through normal channels due to its extremely high voltage. Handle with caution."
msgstr "No se puede obtener por métodos normales debido a su voltaje extremadamente alto. Manejar con precaución."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26145"
msgid "Gravity Converter"
msgstr "Conversor de Gravedad"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109809"
msgid "The instructions call this thing a \"gravity converter prototype.\" Could this be for real?"
msgstr "Las instrucciones llaman esta cosa un \"prototipo conversor de gravedad.\" Será verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26163"
msgid "Small Motor"
msgstr "Motor Pequeño"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109899"
msgid "You won't find a small motor with this kind of horsepower on the open market."
msgstr "No encontrarás un motor pequeño con esta potencia en un mercado cualquiera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26175"
msgid "Broken Radio"
msgstr "Radio Rota"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "109977"
msgid "This broken radio just doesn't sound right. It uses a special circuit board."
msgstr "Esta radio rota no suena bien. Utiliza una placa de circuito especial."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26188"
msgid "Cold Pack"
msgstr "Bolsa helada"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110054"
msgid "This has many uses, from chilling products to keeping down a fever. Best kept in the freezer."
msgstr "Tiene muchos usos, desde enfriar productos hasta bajar la fiebre. Lo mejor es guardarlo en el congelador."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26198"
msgid "Mystery Liquid"
msgstr "Líquido Misterioso"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110148"
msgid "Mysterious, highly viscous liquid. Its use is unknown."
msgstr "Líquido misterioso y altamente viscoso. Su uso es desconocido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26213"
msgid "Super Resin"
msgstr "Super Resina"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110203"
msgid "This Super Resin can be used as a sealant for various purposes."
msgstr "Esta súper resina puede usarse como sellador para diversos fines."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26225"
msgid "Super Resilient Resin"
msgstr "Resina Superresistente"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110267"
msgid "This stuff has a lot of bounce to it."
msgstr "Este material puede rehusarse mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26247"
msgid "Seal of the Dragon"
msgstr "Sello del dragón"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110305"
msgid "A dragon seal that once belonged to a Chinese emperor. Overflows with an awesome presence."
msgstr "Un sello de dragón que perteneció alguna vez a un emperador chino. Desborda una presencia impresionante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26266"
msgid "SSS Gunpowder"
msgstr "Pólvora SSS"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110396"
msgid "Rare gunpowder with great combustion speed and power. Handle with caution."
msgstr "Pólvora rara con gran velocidad de combustión y potencia. Manejar con cuidado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26280"
msgid "Shard of Bulletproof Glass"
msgstr "Trozo de cristal a prueba de balas"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110471"
msgid "A shard of bulletproof glass that can no longer protect people from bullets."
msgstr "Un fragmento de cristal antibalas que ya no puede proteger a las personas de las balas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26307"
msgid "Durable Cloth"
msgstr "Tela Duradera"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110548"
msgid "Said to be the toughest fabric in the world."
msgstr "Se dice que es el tejido más resistente del mundo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26321"
msgid "Large Blow-up Doll"
msgstr "Muñeca Inflable Grande"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110593"
msgid "This would be about the size of a human when fully blown up. I wonder what it's for..."
msgstr "Esto tiene aproximadamente el tamaño de un ser humano cuando está completamente inflado. Me pregunto para qué sirve..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26340"
msgid "Shape Memory Spring"
msgstr "Muelle con Memoria de Forma"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110680"
msgid "This Shape Memory Spring adjusts its tension in response to temperature."
msgstr "Este resorte con memoria de forma ajusta su tensión en respuesta a la temperatura."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26360"
msgid "Rubber Hose"
msgstr "Manguera de Goma"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110753"
msgid "Your average rubber hose."
msgstr "Una manguera de goma común."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26372"
msgid "Stuffed Cat Toy"
msgstr "Peluche de Gato"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110779"
msgid "This popular stuffed toy is fuzzy and soft. Squeezing its belly will make it meow."
msgstr "Este popular peluche es peludo y suave. Si le aprietas la barriga, maullará."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26388"
msgid "Super Glue"
msgstr "Super Pegamento"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110862"
msgid "This stuff is strong enough to hold together a rocket."
msgstr "Este material es lo suficientemente fuerte como para mantener unido un cohete."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26399"
msgid "Multipurpose Thumbtack"
msgstr "Tachuela Multiusos"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110917"
msgid "This is a tough looking tack. Hell, I bet it could penetrate concrete."
msgstr "Es una tachuela de apariencia dura. Apuesto a que podría penetrar el concreto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26422"
msgid "Kamaitachi Utility Knife"
msgstr "Navaja de utilidad Kamaitachi"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "110988"
msgid "Multi-purpose cutter known for its ability to slice through various items."
msgstr "Cortador multiuso conocido por su capacidad para cortar una variedad de objetos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26447"
msgid "Rubber Ball"
msgstr "Bola de Goma"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "111063"
msgid "Kids can throw this around without getting hurt."
msgstr "Los niños pueden lanzarla sin hacerse daño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
