msgctxt "111667"
msgid "These whole dried Chili Peppers are incredibly hot. Be careful not to overdo it."
msgstr "Estos chiles secos son extremadamente picantes. Ten cuidado de no excederte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "26633"
msgid "Iron Nail"
